Preserve inferred package identity when a logical test is compiled under a
separate implementation label. Defaults and explicit/embed precedence remain
unchanged; the logical owner is not a dependency on runtime data.
Experimental extension of rules_go v0.63.0:
https://github.com/bazel-contrib/rules_go/blob/v0.63.0/go/private/context.bzl

